[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12841.349, "timestamp": "03:34:01", "text": "晾干。我想，我想是因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12844.79, "timestamp": "03:34:04", "text": "静音状态下哭了很多次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12848.87, "timestamp": "03:34:08", "text": "我对自己说，我永远不会哭"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12850.95, "timestamp": "03:34:10", "text": "直播中，并指出弱点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12856.229, "timestamp": "03:34:16", "text": "我自己。我觉得是的，说到这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12858.71, "timestamp": "03:34:18", "text": "嗯，是的，说到游戏方面，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12862.07, "timestamp": "03:34:22", "text": "你可能见过像Angel那样的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12864.229, "timestamp": "03:34:24", "text": "引发了真实的反应，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12866.07, "timestamp": "03:34:26", "text": "游戏中一切都很顺利"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12868.71, "timestamp": "03:34:28", "text": "她做的直播。就这样。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12871.75, "timestamp": "03:34:31", "text": "我想我大概哭过17次了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12874.55, "timestamp": "03:34:34", "text": "在 Twitch 上直播。感谢上帝，那些WS"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12878.87, "timestamp": "03:34:38", "text": "不存在。我认为呃，有几个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12882.229, "timestamp": "03:34:42", "text": "外面发生的那些事让我哭了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12886.389, "timestamp": "03:34:46", "text": "东西。我的天哪，我真是个笨蛋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12890.44, "timestamp": "03:34:50", "text": "更像是哭泣，但也有点像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12891.75, "timestamp": "03:34:51", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12894.15, "timestamp": "03:34:54", "text": "呃，更像是不是那种哭泣，而是更像哭泣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12896.55, "timestamp": "03:34:56", "text": "比如发泄情绪或者押韵。我想我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12898.15, "timestamp": "03:34:58", "text": "不知道。"}]